# IsoRim animals batch odysmall2 (blob style): Prairie dog, Porcupine, Armadillo, Macaw, Swan (+ the two flight wings).
# Generated by tools/make_odysmall2_concept.py (prairie dog, armadillo from the v2 run, porcupine from v3, macaw and swan
# with their wings from v1; merged into this one file at integration, 2026-11-20, animals9).
# Kd = the sprite lit white (0.96); the textures hold the sprite colours relative to that white.
# Colours baked (no tintFromGraphic). Macaw, swan: untinted in vanilla. Prairie dog, porcupine, armadillo: vanilla gives
# them a colour with CutoutComplex but ships no mask, so the game draws the sprites as they are (as the badger; checked in
# game, 3D off).
newmtl an_prairiedog_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/PrairieDog

newmtl an_porcupine_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Porcupine

newmtl an_armadillo_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Armadillo

newmtl an_macaw_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Macaw

newmtl an_macaw_wing
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/MacawWing

newmtl an_swan_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Swan

newmtl an_swan_wing
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/SwanWing
